program	exclusivity_parent_child.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	exclusive access violation: `p` is passed as `&var` while also being accessed in the same call
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: exclusive access violation: `p` is passed as `&var` while also being accessed in the same call"
log	"  --> examples/exclusivity_parent_child.saw:21:7"
log	"     |"
log	" 21 |     f(&var p, &p.x)     // whole `p` overlaps its field `p.x`"
log	"     |       ^"
log	"   hint: disjoint access paths are allowed (e.g. `&var p.x` with `&p.y`); give the mutable reference exclusive access"
log	""
log	"error: exclusive access violation: `p` is passed as `&var` while also being accessed in the same call"
log	"  --> examples/exclusivity_parent_child.saw:22:13"
log	"     |"
log	" 22 |     g(&p.x, &var p)     // reverse order still overlaps"
log	"     |             ^"
log	"   hint: disjoint access paths are allowed (e.g. `&var p.x` with `&p.y`); give the mutable reference exclusive access"
log	""
log	"2 error(s) generated"
